WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.771
Two days after the catastrophic collapse of
a critical dam in southern Ukraine, rescue

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:07.399
efforts continue.

00:00:07.399 --> 00:00:12.910
With dramatic scenes like this, taking place
as the scope of the devastation becomes increasingly

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:15.380
clear, as each hour passes.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:22.089
But it is not rising waters posing a challenge
to residents in kherson, homelessness, the

00:00:22.089 --> 00:00:28.210
threat of disease and floating land mines
are all adding to the increased safety risk,

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.820
in addition to the fighting.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:35.000
Ukrainian officials are accusing Russian forces
of shelling evacuation areas, injuring nine

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.129
civilians, one by the way, critically.

00:00:37.129 --> 00:00:43.110
Volodymyr zelenskyy visited earlier and called
for clear and quick global response to the

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:44.110
disaster.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:49.680
In the meantime, they tell CNN Ukraine forces
are being met with stiff resistance as they

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.650
tried to break through Russian lines in the
eastern part of the country.

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.180
CNN's Sam kiley joins us now

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:55.180
[12:02:18 PM]

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:56.180
CNN's Sam kiley joins us now from Kyiv.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:59.670
The fact that Ukrainian soldiers are being
met with stiff resistance, what does that

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:03.569
tell us about the pending counteroffensive,
and how hard it will be?

00:01:03.569 --> 00:01:08.189
&gt;&gt; I don't think it tells us anything at all,
Zain.

00:01:08.189 --> 00:01:10.470
Obviously, they will be met with stiff resistance.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.470
This is a war.

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:15.909
I think the important news is twofold.

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:20.970
First of all, that there have been these probing
attacks along the front line in zaporizhzhia,

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:26.369
which have involved Ukrainian troops, they
have been using some of the nato supplied

00:01:26.369 --> 00:01:27.369
equipment.

00:01:27.369 --> 00:01:32.880
This was always going to be an extremely well
defended frontline, and a lot of the evidence,

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:38.610
particularly on social media is that the Ukrainian
troops are meeting resistance in that area.

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:44.200
At the same time, though, they are now reporting
some significant advances, over three and

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:50.840
a half kilometers, albeit down a fairly narrow
corridor, south of the city of bakhmut, those

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:55.540
advances being reported by Ukraine's third
assault brigade.

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:56.540
[12:03:21 PM]

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:57.540
assault brigade.

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:00.969
This is what some of it looked like.

00:02:00.969 --> 00:02:04.530
&gt;&gt; Ukraine's third assault brigade isn't action
in bakhmut.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:10.360
[Sound of gunfire] And they claim they are
making advances around the city, but their

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:13.209
attack is dependent on soviet-era weapons.

00:02:13.209 --> 00:02:18.970
[Sound of artillery] Modern equipment from
the usa and nato is apparently being held

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:21.719
in reserve for a Ukrainian offensive.

00:02:21.719 --> 00:02:25.850
&gt;&gt; Do you have a name for your grad?

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:28.630
Is a good enough for this fight?

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:35.170
[Speaking non-english]
&gt;&gt; Ukraine gets no help at all with aircraft.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.030
Not so far.

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:39.940
This soviet-era helicopter is ancient.

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:46.800
But in combat almost every day.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:53.050
Flying dangerously low to avoid missiles and
Russian jet hunter killers.

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:57.080
[Speaking non-english]

00:02:57.080 --> 00:03:01.099
[12:04:23 PM]

00:03:01.099 --> 00:03:12.830
[Speaking non-english]
&gt;&gt; These aircraft fly more as fighting intensifies

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:16.940
