00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:22.600
Ukraine has not added rage, at what it is
calling a Russian eco-side.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:27.280
This part of kherson has suffered Russian
bombardment for months.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:30.980
Now, near total destruction from upriver.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:36.860
Russia's widely blamed for the collapse of
the dam at nova kakhovka, which has been under

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.909
its control since March last year.

00:03:39.909 --> 00:03:45.210
Civilians who survived the Russian occupation
of the town and an offensive to free it are

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:47.710
now facing down a new horror.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:50.080
